// Îñíîâíàÿ ñòðóêòóðà: êàñò, íåóÿçâèìîñòü, ïàóçà è âûïóñê âñåõ ñíàðÿäîâ.



    function s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_Loop_MilimR takes nothing returns nothing
        local integer this
        local integer i= 0
        local integer slotIndex
        local real releaseInterval
        local real releaseOffset
        local real slotWidth
        local real lateralOffset
        local real forwardOffset
        local real targetX
        local real targetY
        local real arcSide
        local real add= 90
        local real flightTime
        local boolean createExplosionFx

        loop
            exitwhen i > s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_MUI_MilimR
            set this=s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_m_MilimR[i]

            if SpellBoolCaster(s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_c[this]) and s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_launched[this] < s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_MISSILE_COUNT then
                set s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_r[this]=s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_r[this] + 0.03
                call DebugUnit(s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_c[this])
                if s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_r[this] == 0.3 then
        set s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_e[this]=EffectSpawnScale("war3mapImported\\wos_file00000739.mdl" , GetUnitX(s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_c[this]) + add * Cos(s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_a[this]) , GetUnitY(s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_c[this]) + add * Sin(s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_a[this]) , s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_a[this] * bj_RADTODEG , 1.00 , 1.5 , 100.00 , 0.75 , 1 , 3.45)
        call BlzSetSpecialEffectAlpha(s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_e[this], 150)
        set s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_e2[this]=EffectSpawnScale("war3mapImported\\wos_ChuShou_BY_Wood_Effect_Glow_GuiPaiQiGong_XuLiblue.mdl" , GetUnitX(s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_c[this]) + 90 * Cos(s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_a[this]) , GetUnitY(s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_c[this]) + 90 * Sin(s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_a[this]) , s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_a[this] * bj_RADTODEG , 1.00 , 1 , 100.00 , 0.75 , 1 , 2.5)
        set s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_e3[this]=EffectSpawnScale("war3mapImported\\wos_xtyball2.mdx" , GetUnitX(s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_c[this]) + add * Cos(s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_a[this]) , GetUnitY(s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_c[this]) + add * Sin(s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_a[this]) , s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_a[this] * bj_RADTODEG , 1.00 , 1 , 0.00 , 0.75 , 1 , 1.85)
        
                endif
                if s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_r[this] > 0.3 then
                call BlzSetSpecialEffectPosition(s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_e[this], GetUnitX(s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_c[this]) + add * Cos(s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_a[this]), GetUnitY(s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_c[this]) + add * Sin(s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_a[this]), 0.00)
                call BlzSetSpecialEffectPosition(s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_e2[this], GetUnitX(s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_c[this]) + add * Cos(s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_a[this]), GetUnitY(s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_c[this]) + add * Sin(s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_a[this]), 165.00)
                endif
                set releaseInterval=s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_MISSILE_RELEASE_WINDOW / I2R(s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_MISSILE_COUNT - 1)
                set releaseOffset=I2R(s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_launched[this]) * releaseInterval
                if s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_r[this] == s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_CAST_DELAY + releaseOffset then
                if IntegerCd(s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_c[this] , "cd start" , 1.5) then
        call MakeSound("war3mapimported\\Hero_Milim_R 3")
        endif
        endif
                if s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_r[this] >= s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_CAST_DELAY + releaseOffset then
                    // Î÷åð¸äíîñòü 0, 5, 1, 4, 2, 3: ñíàðÿäû ÷åðåäóþòñÿ ñëåâà è ñïðàâà.
                    if ModuloInteger(s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_launched[this], 2) == 0 then
                        set slotIndex=s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_launched[this] / 2
                        set arcSide=1.00
                    else
                        set slotIndex=s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_MISSILE_COUNT - 1 - s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_launched[this] / 2
                        set arcSide=- 1.00
                    endif

                    // Ýôôåêòû ðàñïðåäåëåíû ïî âñåé øèðèíå ïðÿìîóãîëüíèêà:
                    // îáà êðàÿ, ïðèìåðíî 1/3 è 2/3 îáëàñòè. Äëÿ 10 ñíàðÿäîâ ýòî
                    // ñëîòû 0, 3, 6 è 9 — îíè ìàêñèìàëüíî óäàëåíû äðóã îò äðóãà.
                    set createExplosionFx=slotIndex == 0 or slotIndex == ( s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_MISSILE_COUNT - 1 ) / 3 or slotIndex == ( s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_MISSILE_COUNT - 1 ) * 2 / 3 or slotIndex == s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_MISSILE_COUNT - 1

                    // Ïî îäíîé ñëó÷àéíîé òî÷êå â êàæäîé ïîëîñå ïðÿìîóãîëüíèêà RECT_WIDTH.
                    set slotWidth=s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_RECT_WIDTH / I2R(s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_MISSILE_COUNT)
                    set lateralOffset=- s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_RECT_WIDTH * 0.50 + slotWidth * I2R(slotIndex) + GetRandomReal(0.00, slotWidth)
                    set forwardOffset=GetRandomReal(- s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_RECT_DEPTH * 0.50, s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_RECT_DEPTH * 0.50)
                    set targetX=s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_x[this] + forwardOffset * Cos(s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_a[this]) + lateralOffset * Cos(s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_a[this] + 90.00 * bj_DEGTORAD)
                    set targetY=s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_y[this] + forwardOffset * Sin(s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_a[this]) + lateralOffset * Sin(s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_a[this] + 90.00 * bj_DEGTORAD)

                    // ×åì ïîçæå âûëåòåë ñíàðÿä, òåì ìåíüøå âðåìÿ ïîë¸òà.
                    // Âñå øåñòü ïðèëåòàþò ïðèìåðíî â îäèí ìîìåíò.
                    set flightTime=s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_MISSILE_MIN_FLIGHT_TIME + s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_MISSILE_RELEASE_WINDOW - releaseOffset

                    // ÇÀÒÛ×ÊÀ: êîðîòêèé ýôôåêò ïðè âûïóñêå êàæäîãî ñíàðÿäà.
                    call DestroyEffect(EffectSpawn("war3mapImported\\wos_effect lvse-magic-shousuo blue.mdl" , GetUnitX(s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_c[this]) + add * Cos(s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_a[this]) , GetUnitY(s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_c[this]) + add * Sin(s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_a[this]) , GetRandomReal(0, 359) , 1.00 , 2.00 , 120.00))
                    call SaveInteger(hs, GetHandleId(s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_g[this]), StringHash("MilimR projectiles left"), LoadInteger(hs, GetHandleId(s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_g[this]), StringHash("MilimR projectiles left")) + 1)
                    call s__MilimSpells___MilimRProjectileKS_MilimRProjectile_Start(s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_c[this] , GetUnitX(s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_c[this]) + add * Cos(s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_a[this]) , GetUnitY(s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_c[this]) + add * Sin(s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_a[this]) , targetX , targetY , arcSide , GetRandomReal(s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_ARC_MIN, s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_ARC_MAX) , GetUnitFlyHeight(s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_c[this]) + GetRandomReal(110.00, 230.00) , flightTime , s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_dmg[this] , s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_g[this] , s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_g2[this] , createExplosionFx)
                    set s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_launched[this]=s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_launched[this] + 1
                endif
            else
                call PauseUnit(s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_c[this], false)
                call StopSpellUnit(s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_c[this])
                call SetUnitTimeScale(s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_c[this], 1.00)
                call DestroyEffect(s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_e[this])
                call DestroyEffect(s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_e2[this])
                call DestroyEffect(s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_e3[this])
                if LoadInteger(hs, GetHandleId(s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_g[this]), StringHash("MilimR projectiles left")) <= 0 then
                    call FlushChildHashtable(hs, GetHandleId(s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_g[this]))
                    call DestroyGroup(s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_g[this])
                    call DestroyGroup(s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_g2[this])
                endif
                set s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_e[this]=null
                set s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_e2[this]=null
                set s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_e3[this]=null
                set s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_g[this]=null
                set s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_g2[this]=null
                set s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_c[this]=null

                set s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_m_MilimR[i]=s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_m_MilimR[s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_MUI_MilimR]
                set s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_MUI_MilimR=s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_MUI_MilimR - 1
                if s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_MUI_MilimR == - 1 then
                    call PauseTimer(s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_t_MilimR)
                endif
                call s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_deallocate(this)
                set i=i - 1
            endif

            set i=i + 1
        endloop
    endfunction

    function s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_MilimR_Start takes unit NewC,real NewX,real NewY returns nothing
        local integer this= s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS__allocate()

        set s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_MUI_MilimR=s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_MUI_MilimR + 1
        set s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_m_MilimR[s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_MUI_MilimR]=this
        set s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_c[this]=NewC
        set s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_x[this]=NewX
        set s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_y[this]=NewY
        set s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_a[this]=GAngle2(s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_c[this] , s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_x[this] , s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_y[this])
        set s__MilimSpells___MilimRKS_r[this]=0.00
